<description>&lt;p&gt;The rebuilt flood damaged town is being promoted as a showcase for the Libyan strongman’s rule. Fezzan revolutionaries continue to contest Haftar’s control in southern Libya, while the Libyan zoo welcomed its first white tiger cub months after reopening. The House of Representatives condemned the obstruction of a parliamentary session in Zintan and the armed closure of Zintan Airport. The UN welcomed new laws that raise the recruitment age to 18 and criminalise the conscription of minors. Libya holds Africa’s largest oil reserves but Western majors are not investing, and there were 2 battle related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQZzNVX2NPYXpBVE1pZmVJOEdPcnJJeVYtcW5LTThGcHNuWFY5dnFFQXZhUGdxQURCd00wWndoVWdGNGRxM0xPOUR4T3IwVVNyXzl4enl0dlB1OHV0N0xvSlJ2d2JVaUJZbjJFYnJSX0Z1NkJ1dmRJSXk4NWxwRjV0Z29ZUkJJQmJIQWJ2end0TGpDc1ppcDZ2ZG54T0NWYkVlNWRKOE1R?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1LNWtaVkVtaWR5blozTVduaVhRQXp2UEJhakxwMHhERGpxN2dxSmJzWnpRVktBWHllUWRGb1VacnZlTDFidGxCamNCUWNlQVdTZFpRRnVPM181aEE5TXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNblFEaVBRNHNNMVhaZTNIX1A5RTR4Rm9iLWxrRGFHVnFnckZITHpuYWkzX3RVdmVzb3p3MFRLcGdNTXhQTnAyekdSaThERDlfcHpNRS1YMmJtUGJTdHNpVzdsWTdPTXJia2lpejEwS244MVdlcndGZ1dCekJoZjFkRE5aY2xkbUJVNV9vT2FHaW1nQU4tLURER3FQS3JqUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;GhanaSoccernet&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPX3JKN3JZUGxPTzVRWjJxN3hUYlk2UlFTM1l1VFBlSkFOTGJ3MFBYWlFsOWVxUXRuZjc4b3B6WlNJNk5OV2ZBTEJPV3JvUTNuOFJmblN2dEQ2RHl6aGd2aFhlVmRLdWF6Z1FFNWtfcGUtU3h6TU1HQlIyU0djdkc4YmE4S0dFQnVGeXYteG1fQTBfb1F4TnEzRTR5M2FoTDlUNk96TTl6MzFTUTBDQWl1ag?oc=5&quot;&gt;GhanaSoccernet&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a h